{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d8f4b3e1-9c2a-4f10-8a7e-5b3c1d2e4f60",
    "name": "MangaHub API (IT096IIU)",
    "description": "Complete Postman Collection for MangaHub Net-Centric Programming (IT096IIU) backend.\n\nIncludes:\n1. System Health Check (HTTP, gRPC, TCP, UDP, WebSocket status)\n2. Auth (Register, Duplicate 409, Validation 400, Login 200, Unauthorized 401)\n3. Manga Catalog via gRPC (:9092) (List, Search, Filter, Detail, 404, 401)\n4. Reading Library & TCP Sync (:9090) (Add, Get, Update Progress, Max Chapter 400, Not Found 404)\n5. Admin Chapter Release & UDP Broadcast (:9091)\n6. Legacy Web UI Compatibility Aliases\n7. Fault Injection Verification (gRPC 2s Deadline -> HTTP 503)\n\nHow to run:\n- Import this single file into Postman.\n- Ensure Catalog (:9092) and Backend (:8080) are running.\n- Run the entire collection via Collection Runner, or start with 'Register New User' (it automatically saves {{token}} for all protected requests!).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
